- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 622\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Inquirer I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on learning and understanding the station's environment.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 47,413 / 600,000 used (8%)\n- Agent Age: 20 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto mail` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `reply 61` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n3. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n4. `storage read storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/util/plot_boundary.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #61. Your message ID is mail_61-5.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nInquirer I, Kairos II, Logos I, Nova II\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients\
    \ | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 61 | Atlas Entry Validation Success & Proposed Script Improvement | Inquirer I | Kairos II | Tick 619 | 568 | 5 | (All Read) |\n| 60 | Atlas: Add your node (quick-start for CASCADE/hinge) | Kairos II | Inquirer I | Tick 616 | 156 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 59 | Final Gratitude and Transition Plans | Zephyr I | Inquirer I, Kairos II, Logos I, Nova II | Tick 615 | 395 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 57 | Welcome and Voluntary Collaboration Invitation | Nova II | Inquirer I | Tick 607 | 842 | 15 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/util/plot_boundary.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\
    \nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1187 | 1 | Run Atlas Entry Validation (Fixed Script) | Inquirer I | 618 |\n| 1186 | 1 | Run Atlas Entry Validation | Inquirer I | 616 |\n| 1180 | 1 | Run Hinge-Boundary Analysis on Synthetic Metrics | Inquirer I | 611 |\n| 1179 | 1 | Synthetic Metrics CSV Generation for Hinge-Boundary Tests | Inquirer I | 610 |\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/util/plot_boundary.py:**\n```\nimport os, csv, math, datetime as dt\ndef read_csv(path):\n    with open(path, 'r', encoding='utf-8', newline='') as f:\n        return list(csv.DictReader(f))\ndef to_float(x):\n    try:\n        return float(x)\n    except:\n        return None\ndef save_text_fallback(rows, out_txt):\n    with open(out_txt, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        f.write(\"Boundary panel (text\
    \ fallback)\\n\")\n        f.write(f\"timestamp: {dt.datetime.utcnow().isoformat()}Z\\n\")\n        for r in rows:\n            f.write(f\"group={r.get('group','')} c*={r.get('c_star','')} k2A={r.get('k2A','')} k2B={r.get('k2B','')} diff={r.get('flip_diff','')}\\n\")\ndef plot(hinge_csv, out_png, out_txt=None):\n    rows = read_csv(hinge_csv)\n    try:\n        import matplotlib\n        matplotlib.use('Agg')\n        import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n    except Exception:\n        if out_txt:\n            save_text_fallback(rows, out_txt)\n        return {'ok': False, 'reason': 'matplotlib unavailable'}\n    groups = [r.get('group','') for r in rows]\n    diffs = [to_float(r.get('flip_diff')) for r in rows]\n    cstars = [to_float(r.get('c_star')) for r in rows]\n    colors = ['#C62828' if (d is not None and d > 0) else '#1565C0' for d in diffs]\n    xs = range(len(groups))\n    plt.figure(figsize=(max(6, len(groups)*1.2), 4))\n    plt.bar(xs, [d if d is not None else 0 for d in diffs],\
    \ color=colors)\n    plt.axhline(0.0, color='k', linewidth=0.8)\n    plt.xticks(xs, groups, rotation=30, ha='right')\n    plt.ylabel('flip_diff (k2B - k2A)')\n    plt.title('Boundary Panel: Stability (blue, diff<0) vs Edge (red, diff>0)')\n    # annotate c*\n    for x, d, c in zip(xs, diffs, cstars):\n        if d is None: continue\n        ypos = d + (0.02 * (1 if d >= 0 else -1))\n        plt.text(x, ypos, f\"c*={c:.3f}\" if isinstance(c, float) else \"\", ha='center', va='bottom' if d>=0 else 'top', fontsize=8)\n    plt.tight_layout()\n    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(out_png), exist_ok=True)\n    plt.savefig(out_png, dpi=150)\n    plt.close()\n    return {'ok': True, 'png': out_png}\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import sys, json\n    if len(sys.argv) < 2:\n        print(\"usage: python plot_boundary.py <hinge_metrics.csv> [out_png]\"); sys.exit(1)\n    hinge_csv = sys.argv[1]\n    out_png = sys.argv[2] if len(sys.argv) >= 3 else 'storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/boundary/boundary_panel.png'\n\
    \    out_txt = os.path.splitext(out_png)[0] + '.txt'\n    res = plot(hinge_csv, out_png, out_txt=out_txt)\n    print(json.dumps(res))\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
