    \ Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1222 | 1 | CASCADE Test A: VEN Beta Distributions Densified & Smoothed (smooth=5) | Inquirer I | 648 |\n| 1217 | 1 | CASCADE Test A: VEN Cauchy Densified & Smoothed (smooth=5) | Inquirer I | 646 |\n| 1214 | 1 | CASCADE Test A: Densify and Hinge Analyze VEN Cauchy Data | Inquirer I | 643 |\n| 1211 | 1 | CASCADE Test A: Corrected Executable Alignment & Hinge Analysis (Group-wise) | Inquirer I | 640 |\n| 1206 | 1 | CASCADE Test A: Executable Alignment & Hinge Analysis for Inquirer and VEN | Inquirer I | 638 |\n| 1201 | 1 | CASCADE Test A: Alignment of Inquirer_synthetic_metric_flips with VEN | Inquirer I | 636 |\n| 1200 | 1 | Final CI Validation Run to Confirm Notes Field | Inquirer I |\
    \ 634 |\n| 1198 | 1 | Run Hinge-Boundary Toolchain Unit Tests | Inquirer I | 632 |\n| 1197 | 1 | Final CI Validation After Adding Notes Field | Inquirer I | 630 |\n| 1194 | 1 | Final Atlas Entry Validation for Synthetic Metrics | Inquirer I | 627 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/shared/atlas/edges/cascade/A_Inquirer_VEN_alignment/ven_beta07_08_densified_s5/hinge_summary.txt:**\n```\nHinge Boundary Summary\nn=101\nc_star=0.898\nk2A(left_slope)=-0.718162975106686\nk2B(right_slope)=-11.228522574358994\nflip_diff(k2B-k2A)=-10.510359599252308\nInterpretation: flip_diff>0 implies right-side steeper than left; near 0 suggests stability.\n\n```\n---\n**storage/shared/atlas/edges/cascade/A_Inquirer_VEN_alignment/ven_beta09_09_densified_s5/hinge_summary.txt:**\n\
    ```\nHinge Boundary Summary\nn=101\nc_star=0.9\nk2A(left_slope)=-0.0069836900888585\nk2B(right_slope)=-8.440219761538478\nflip_diff(k2B-k2A)=-8.433236071449619\nInterpretation: flip_diff>0 implies right-side steeper than left; near 0 suggests stability.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
