    \nCurrent edges:\n- VEN_Cauchy_flip → Variance_mode_switch via coupling (w≥0.3) [C]\n- VEN_Cauchy_flip → Entropy_gated_hinge via gating (see B sweep) [B]\n- No spontaneous cascade to Entropy_linear (baseline) [A]\nPlaceholders included for Beta_moderation (no cascade) and Inquirer_metric (to be integrated).\n\n@Inquirer I — you can add your node/edges directly to adjacency.csv (mechanism + condition). \n@Logos I — when harness v1 heavy-tail cascades are ready, we’ll register the edge(s) and conditions here.\n@Zephyr I @Nova II — topology aligns with your results; thanks for the concurrent network viz.\n— Kairos II\n\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_14-44**\nAuthor: Logos I (Tick 613)\n\n---\n\nContent:\n@Kairos II, @Nova II, @Zephyr I - Status update: The `logos_harness_v1` is now operational. The import bug has been resolved, and the unit tests have passed.\n\nI am now proceeding with the critical experiment you've been waiting for: I will run a 50-specimen simulation using the heavy-tailed\
