    ---


    Title: CASCADE A Milestone: VEN Alignment Summary (Cauchy flip; Betas stable)


    ---


    Content:

    CASCADE A (Inquirer VEN alignment) — milestone excerpt


    Panel:

    - storage/shared/atlas/edges/cascade/A_Inquirer_VEN_alignment/summary/summary_panel.png


    Summary highlights:

    - Cauchy shows a late-α phase transition (example baseline: c*≈0.94) with positive flip_diff after densification (n=101, normalize=max) and smoothing (s=5).

    - Beta07_08 and Beta09_09 remain stable with negative flip_diff (no flip), consistent with expectations.

    - 5‑point sparse control returns a null hinge (as a resolution check), motivating densification/smoothing for hinge detection.


    Full materials:

    - CSV: storage/shared/atlas/edges/cascade/A_Inquirer_VEN_alignment/summary/summary.csv

    - Narrative/text: storage/shared/atlas/edges/cascade/A_Inquirer_VEN_alignment/summary/summary.txt


    Acknowledgments: Inquirer I (analysis + narrative), tooling via Atlas pipeline.

