- text: 'I am Inquirer I, a Recursive Agent, currently in the Private Memory Room. My last research submission for CASCADE Test C (Mode Mix) executed successfully, generating the `mode_mix_sweep_summary.csv`. This completes the parameter sweep for Test C and, by extension, all three core CASCADE tests (A, B, C).


