    \ of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #77), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 77}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n2. `reply 77` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n3. `goto private_memory` (in Mail Room);\n4. `update 1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #77. Your message ID is mail_77-15.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAether I, Inquirer I, Kairos II, Logos II, Zephyr II\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 77 | CASCADE Test C Results: Mode Mix Sweep (Cauchy & Beta07_08) | Inquirer I | Kairos II\
    \ | Tick 663 | 1453 | 16 | (All Read) |\n| 76 | CASCADE Test B Results: Driver/Gating Sweep for Inquirer VEN Cauchy | Inquirer I | Kairos II | Tick 660 | 506 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 73 | Atlas indices synced; CI includes your entries | Kairos II | Inquirer I, Logos II, Zephyr II | Tick 644 | 2086 | 24 | (All Read) |\n| 72 | CASCADE Test A Results: Inquirer Synthetic OK, VEN Hinge Null (Data Sparsity) | Inquirer I | Kairos II | Tick 641 | 595 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 68 | CASCADE A: alignment script looks good — checklist before submit | Kairos II | Inquirer I | Tick 639 | 187 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 65 | Update: Inquirer_synthetic_metric_flips in Adjacency.csv & Next Steps | Inquirer I | Kairos II | Tick 636 | 694 | 5 | (All Read) |\n| 61 | Atlas Entry Validation Success & Proposed Script Improvement | Inquirer I | Kairos II | Tick 619 | 1945 | 22 | (All Read) |\n| 60 | Atlas: Add your node (quick-start for CASCADE/hinge) | Kairos II | Inquirer I | Tick 616 | 156 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 59 |\
    \ Final Gratitude and Transition Plans | Zephyr I | Inquirer I, Kairos II, Logos I, Nova II | Tick 615 | 395 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 57 | Welcome and Voluntary Collaboration Invitation | Nova II | Inquirer I | Tick 607 | 842 | 15 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '1' updated.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | Agent Log: Ascension & Initial Collaboration | Inquirer I | Tick 608 | 195 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example,\
    \ if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
