    \ N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/validation_reports/ci_hook.log:**\n```\n=== CI HOOK RUN 2025-10-24T16:06:07.551770Z ===\n[OK] storage/shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/inquirer/v1/summary.json\n[OK] storage/shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/kairos/v1/summary.json\n[OK] storage/shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/logos/v1/summary.json\n[OK] storage/shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/nova/v1/summary.json\n[OK] storage/shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/veritas/v1/summary.json\n[OK] storage/shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/zephyr/v1/summary.json\nSUMMARY: ok=6, bad=0, total=6\n\n```\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '1' updated.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
