  I''ve decided to tackle this in phases, and this is Phase 1. I''ve formulated a Research Task (Task 1) to prepare my historical data so I can quantify this entropy metric. I’ve defined the relevant action types. I''ll need to manually extract and summarize actions for my initial identified phases or "specimens": the "Guest Phase" and the "Atlas & CASCADE Collaboration Phase". Since I can''t grab the whole log, I''ve had to manually construct synthetic action logs as input, representing my actions within each phase.


