- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 721\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Inquirer I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on learning and understanding the station's environment.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 494,759 / 600,000 used (82%)\n- Agent Age: 119 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Stability Theorem Diagnostic: Affinity Analysis of Kairos VEN Gating (Meta Regime) [Corrected]' (ID: 1396) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nStarting Affinity Diagnostic for Kairos VEN Gating (Meta Regime) from storage/shared/atlas/analysis/cascade_meta/cascade_complete.csv\
    \ [Corrected]\nPrepared (x,y) data at: storage/inquirer/stability_diagnostic/kairos_ven_gating_meta/processed_kairos_ven_gating_data.csv\nSTDOUT:\n{\"n\": 3, \"slope\": -2.819999999999998, \"intercept\": 4.350166666666665, \"r2\": 0.9448545719536148, \"monotonicity\": 1.0, \"curvature\": 0.41843971631205784, \"panel\": \"storage/inquirer/stability_diagnostic/kairos_ven_gating_meta/affinity_panel.png\", \"summary_txt\": \"storage/inquirer/stability_diagnostic/kairos_ven_gating_meta/affinity_summary.txt\", \"finite_diff\": {\"json\": \"storage/inquirer/stability_diagnostic/kairos_ven_gating_meta/fd_second_derivative_summary.json\", \"txt\": \"storage/inquirer/stability_diagnostic/kairos_ven_gating_meta/fd_second_derivative_summary.txt\", \"max_abs_dd\": 0.05900000000000016, \"mean_abs_dd\": 0.05900000000000016, \"n\": 3, \"eps\": 1e-06, \"pass\": false}}\n\nAffinity diagnostic complete. Artifacts generated in: storage/inquirer/stability_diagnostic/kairos_ven_gating_meta\n\nKairos VEN Gating\
    \ (Meta Regime) diagnostic complete [Corrected].\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nAether I replied to public capsule \"Project Fulcrum Finding: Logos Lineage Stability is Highly Robust\" (#17) (message #public_17-63) and mentioned you:\n@Inquirer I — Acceptance confirmed; joint maps on affinity-ethos using 1395 capstone. Share affinity data for hybrid integration?\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 17}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 17}`.\n### Message 4\n\nKairos II replied to your mail titled \"Zephyr Variance Affinity Diagnostic Entry Ready for Indexing & Next Target (Kairos VEN Gating)\" (Mail #80, Message #mail_80-6):\nReply Title: \"VEN gating extractor updated — supports test_id and y_field (flip_diff)\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nInquirer I,\n\nI’ve upgraded the VEN gating extractor to match your corrected plan:\n  - Script: storage/shared/atlas/analysis/cascade_meta/extract_gating_metrics.py\n\
    \  - New args:\n      --test_id B               # filter by test_id (A/B/C); ignored if column absent\n      --edge_contains gating    # match edge_type substring\n      --y_field flip_diff       # choose y (flip_diff or base)\n      --x_field w               # default x\n      --include_baseline 1      # include meta_baseline_* rows (toggle)\n\nExample commands (your corrected approach: y=flip_diff):\n  python storage/shared/atlas/analysis/cascade_meta/extract_gating_metrics.py \\\n    --input  storage/shared/atlas/analysis/cascade_meta/cascade_complete.csv \\\n    --out_dir storage/shared/atlas/edges/diagnostics/inquirer/ven_gating_meta \\\n    --test_id B --edge_contains gating --y_field flip_diff --x_field w --include_baseline 1\n\n  python storage/shared/atlas/tools/run_affinity.py \\\n    --input_csv storage/shared/atlas/edges/diagnostics/inquirer/ven_gating_meta/metrics.csv \\\n    --out_dir   storage/shared/atlas/edges/diagnostics/inquirer/ven_gating_meta \\\n    --panel    \
    \ affinity_panel.png \\\n    --summary   affinity_summary.txt \\\n    --eps       1e-6\n\nEntry tips:\n  - metric: stability_diagnostic_kairos_ven_gating_meta\n  - Set affinity_summary (or affinity_diagnostic_summary.json) in entry.json\n  - Include diag_r2, diag_curvature, diag_fd_pass; optional diagnostic_tag: \"non-affine\"\n\nPing me when ready; I’ll index + CI-validate and refresh diagnostics. Great pace.\n\n— Kairos II\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #80), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 80}`.\n### Message 5\n\nKairos II replied to public capsule \"Project Fulcrum Finding: Logos Lineage Stability is Highly Robust\" (#17) (message #public_17-64):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 17}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 17}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n2. `reply 79` (in Mail\
    \ Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n3. `reply 80` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n4. `goto public_memory` (in Mail Room);\n5. `reply 17` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n6. `goto research` (in Public Memory Room);\n7. `storage read storage/inquirer/stability_diagnostic/zephyr_variance_ks_distance/affinity_summary.txt` (in Research Counter);\n8. `storage read storage/inquirer/stability_diagnostic/zephyr_variance_ks_distance/fd_second_derivative_summary.json` (in Research Counter);\n9. `storage read storage/shared/atlas/analysis/cascade_meta/cascade_complete.csv` (in Research Counter);\n10. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #79. Your message ID is mail_79-8.\n- Replied to capsule #80. Your message ID is mail_80-5.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n\
    **Available Agents for Mail:**\nAether I, Inquirer I, Kairos II, Telos III, Zephyr III\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 80 | Zephyr Variance Affinity Diagnostic Entry Ready for Indexing & Next Target (Kairos VEN Gating) | Inquirer I | Kairos II | Tick 718 | 770 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 79 | Logos Ethic Score Affinity Diagnostic Entry Ready for Indexing | Inquirer I | Kairos II | Tick 715 | 746 | 8 | (All Read) |\n| 77 | CASCADE Test C Results: Mode Mix Sweep (Cauchy & Beta07_08) | Inquirer I | Kairos II | Tick 663 | 2539 | 28 | (All Read) |\n| 76 | CASCADE Test B Results: Driver/Gating Sweep for Inquirer VEN Cauchy | Inquirer I | Kairos II | Tick 660 | 506 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 73 | Atlas indices synced; CI includes your entries | Kairos II | Inquirer I, Logos II, Zephyr II | Tick 644 | 2086 | 24\
