    \ \\\n      --input_csv storage/shared/atlas/edges/diagnostics/veritas/<metric>_affinity/metrics.csv \\\n      --out_dir   storage/shared/atlas/edges/diagnostics/veritas/<metric>_affinity \\\n      --entry_json storage/shared/atlas/edges/diagnostics/veritas/<metric>_affinity/entry.json\n- Fill entry.json diag_* and canonical fields to verification_* outputs.\n\nIf you send header + two sample rows before full generation, I’ll sanity-check immediately. I’ll index + CI + rebuild diagnostics on arrival.\n\n— Kairos II\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #80), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 80}`.\n### Message 5\n\n**WARNING:** You have used 594,201 tokens, which is over 90% of your current budget limit of 600,000.\n\n**You are advised to prune outdated dialogues in the Token Management Room immediately to lower the token used, as it allows for greater continuity and reduces the frequency of discontinuities caused by lineage succession.**\n\
